[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0046","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0055","title":"Solaris chkperm 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 chkperm 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 -n 选项传递超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0055"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方补丁 106327-01 (Solaris 2.6) 或 106725-01 (Solaris 7)。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 0555 /bin/chkperm` 移除 setuid 位，阻止非授权用户提权利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/918","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0055","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0055.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpp8-gj33-w52q/GHSA-jpp8-gj33-w52q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/918/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0055.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3f0ec3d0-95c4-4a6c-82ea-cedb1bef5a02.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0048","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0058","title":"The user wants me to generate a title field for CVE-2000-0058. Let me analyze the information: - Product: Handspring Visor - Feature: Network HotSync - Issue: No authentication, allowing remote attackers to retrieve email and files - This is an authentication bypass vulnerability The format should be: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" Manufacturer: Handspring (Handspring公司) Product: Visor (Visor掌上电脑) Vulnerability type: 认证缺失漏洞 / 远程信息泄露漏洞 Let me think about the best translation: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" or \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 远程信息泄露漏洞\" The core issue is that Network HotSync has no authentication, allowing remote attackers to retrieve email and files. So it's an authentication bypass / missing authentication vulnerability. I'll go with something like: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" Actually, let me look at the original title more carefully: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync漏洞\" - this is the AVD title. The NVD description says: \"Network HotSync program in Handspring Visor does not have authentication, which allows remote attackers to retrieve email and files.\" So it's an authentication bypass / missing authentication vulnerability leading to information disclosure. Title: \"Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞\" That's concise and follows the format: manufacturer \"Handspring\", product \"Visor Network HotSync\", vulnerability type \"认证缺失漏洞\".Handspring Visor Network HotSync 认证缺失漏洞 <value","description":"Handspring Visor 移动设备的 Network HotSync 程序缺乏身份认证机制，远程攻击者可在同一网络段内直接连接目标设备的 HotSync 服务端口，无需任何凭证即可越权访问设备中的电子邮件、联系人、日历等个人数据文件。该漏洞影响 Handspring Visor 系列掌上设备，攻击者仅需与目标处于同一网络即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0058"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"Handspring Visor 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议禁用 Network HotSync 功能，仅在需要时临时开启；在防火墙上限制 14238/TCP 端口的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接；避免在不受信任的网络（如公共 Wi-Fi）上使用 HotSync 同步功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.security-express.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-01/0085.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0058","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0058.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7m79-fmrv-9w39/GHSA-7m79-fmrv-9w39.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/920/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0058.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/pre2008/hotsync.nasl","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001087.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0047","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0056","title":"Ipswitch IMail IMonitor status.cgi 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 5.0.8/6.0/6.1 版本中的 IMonitor 组件 status.cgi CGI 脚本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向该脚本发送大量请求导致服务资源耗尽，造成 IMail 邮件服务拒绝服务。此漏洞影响 Ipswitch IMail 5.0.8、6.0 及 6.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0056"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.2 或更高版本以修复该漏洞；如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 `/cgi-bin/status.cgi` 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 通过防火墙规则访问 IMonitor 服务端口（默认为 8383），并限制单个 IP 的请求速率以缓解 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/914","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19711","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0056","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0056.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wp6p-mrc4-c787/GHSA-wp6p-mrc4-c787.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0056.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/imail_imonitor_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0047.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0047.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0222","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0085","title":"Microsoft Hotmail 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Hotmail 未对用户邮件中的 JavaScript 代码进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过向受害者发送包含恶意 IMG 标签的特制邮件触发漏洞，当受害者使用 Hotmail 打开邮件时，LOWSRC 或 DYNRC 参数中嵌入的恶意脚本将在浏览器中自动执行，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Hotmail 网页邮件服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0085"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"微软已通过服务器端更新修复此漏洞，方案包括：1) 对 IMG 标签的 LOWSRC 和 DYNRC 属性实施严格的输入过滤，禁止嵌入 JavaScript 代码；2) 启用 HTML 邮件内容安全策略（CSP），阻止内联脚本执行；3) 建议用户启用邮件纯文本模式，在 Outlook.com 设置中关闭 HTML 渲染作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0085","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0085","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0085.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f4j7-89mf-xg78/GHSA-f4j7-89mf-xg78.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0085.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/hotmail_cve.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0168","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0059","title":"PHP PHP 3.0.13 Safe Mode 绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 3.0.13 的 safe_mode 功能在调用 popen 执行命令时未能正确过滤 shell 元字符，远程攻击者可通过向使用 popen 函数且开启 safe_mode 的 PHP 应用程序提交特制输入，注入恶意 shell 命令并执行，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 3.0.13 版本，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。目前官方已停止维护该版本，建议升级至修复版本或关闭 safe_mode 并采用其他安全措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0059"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 3.0.14 或更高版本，该版本修复了 popen() 函数在 safe_mode 开启时未正确过滤 shell 元字符的问题。如无法升级，应禁用 popen()、exec()、system() 等命令执行函数，并对所有用户输入进行严格的 escapeshellarg() 过滤，避免直接传入 shell 环境。长期方案应迁移至受支持的 PHP 版本（如 8.x），并停用已废弃的 safe_mode 机制，改用正规权限控制方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/911","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19708","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0059","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0059.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0059.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/PHP3%20'safe_mode'%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0059).html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qq3m-73fj-v56q/GHSA-qq3m-73fj-v56q.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0059.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e24da15d-1372-4be7-a3a5-8f73b3ffc015.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0111","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0057","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server CFCACHE 标签缓存文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.0 及 4.0.1 版本中的 CFCACHE 标签会将临时缓存文件存放于 Web 文档根目录下，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接访问这些缓存文件，从而获取包含数据库连接信息、源代码路径等在内的敏感系统信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响 ColdFusion 4.x 系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0057"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"升级至 ColdFusion 4.5 及以上版本以修复 CFCACHE 标签缓存文件泄露问题；若无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）配置中禁止访问 /CFCACHE/ 目录及所有 .cfm 缓存文件，或将缓存目录移至 Web 根目录之外。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=13978&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/917","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19712","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0057","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0a309958ebbad3dacba1bf7fdb76896365afc06f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-00xx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0e77f8a024b0f1e940623a2d9b4240b792512f14/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0057.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/e8beafdc87407b6ccd406c377327b8bfe727cd66/api/2000/CVE-2000-0057.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0109","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0053","title":"Microsoft Commercial Internet System IMAP 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Commercial Internet System (MCIS) 2.0 及 2.5 版本中的 IMAP 服务存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 IMAP 请求报文，触发服务组件在处理请求时发生异常，从而导致 IMAP 服务进程崩溃并拒绝为合法用户提供服务。该漏洞可被用于对部署了 MCIS 邮件服务的系统实施拒绝服务攻击，影响范围涉及使用 MCIS 的 Windows 服务器环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0053"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-001 提供的补丁。Intel 平台补丁下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=03140610-f69c-4d34-b441-32c1a2abb1ed；Alpha 平台补丁下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?familyid=2cc2d73f-8493-4b8a-9e47-93673a522e70。由于 MCIS 已停止支持，如无法安装补丁，应在防火墙限制对 IMAP 服务（TCP 143 端口）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 范围连接，并迁移至受支持的邮件服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ246731","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/912","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-001","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0053","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0053.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4r76-hhh5-w3m9/GHSA-4r76-hhh5-w3m9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0053.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001081.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0045","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0052","title":"Red Hat userhelper PAM 路径遍历本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux usermode 软件包中的 userhelper 程序存在路径遍历漏洞，本地用户可利用 PAM 模块结合 ..（点点）目录跳转攻击绕过权限检查，从而获取 root 超级用户权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat 6.x、Mandrake 6.x 及 Turbolinux 3.5 b2/4.x/6.0.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证即可实施提权攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0052"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"立即升级 usermode 软件包至 1.28 及以上版本（对应 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2000-001），该修复禁止 userhelper 处理包含 .. 的 PAM 配置文件路径参数。如无法立即升级，可临时移除 /usr/sbin/userhelper 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/userhelper），阻断普通用户以 root 权限执行 userhelper 的利用路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/pam_advisory","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/913","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=linux-pam-userhelper","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19710","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0052.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0052","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0052.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxvc-f794-62r9/GHSA-cxvc-f794-62r9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0052.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--57ff4e67-7202-4608-8a13-7b344961a16b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0045.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0045.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0043","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0051","title":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 Configuration Wizard 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 的配置向导存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送恶意的 URL 请求，反复提交数据集合进行索引操作，导致服务器资源耗尽，从而使服务不可用。该漏洞影响 Allaire Spectra 1.0 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0051"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:54Z","remediation":"限制对 Allaire Spectra Configuration Wizard 的访问，通过 Web 服务器（如 IIS）或防火墙配置仅允许受信任 IP 访问 /spectra/config/ 路径。在生产环境中彻底禁用或移除 Configuration Wizard 组件，防止外部通过 URL 重复提交索引请求导致拒绝服务。如无法禁用，在 Web 服务器层面对该路径添加请求频率限制（rate limiting）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=13977&Method=Full","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/916","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-lis