"CVE-2000-0049"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53Z","remediation":"升级 Winamp 至 2.11 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。鉴于 Winamp 已停止更新维护，建议迁移至其他仍受支持的音频播放软件（如 VLC、foobar2000），避免打开来源不明的 .pls 播放列表文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/12022","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/925","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19720","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0049","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0049.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b1a41e76ddb7196d486fdca460e90fc3919fc12d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q6fm-rqxf-7hgj/GHSA-q6fm-rqxf-7hgj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/925/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0049.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d554a8d2-2f56-47b0-89e0-1127877c6ad5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0200","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0062","title":"Zope Z Object Publishing Environment DTML 远程未授权操作漏洞","description":"Zope 对象发布环境（Z Object Publishing Environment）中的 DTML（Document Template Markup Language）实现存在权限绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 DTML 模板引擎对用户权限检查不充分的缺陷，在未经认证的情况下执行任意 DTML 代码、访问或修改受保护的资源数据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，广泛影响 Zope 系列产品，建议用户升级至安全版本或应用官方补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0062"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-01-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Zope 2.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 DTML 权限检查缺陷。若无法升级，在 Zope 管理界面中限制 DTML 方法仅允许管理员角色执行，或禁用未使用的 DTML Document 对象创建权限。在网络层面限制来源 IP 访问 Zope 管理端口以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/922","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000104222219.B41650%40schvin.net"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0068","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0082","title":"WebTV 电子邮件客户端 HTML注入漏洞","description":"WebTV 电子邮件客户端在处理 HTML 格式邮件时存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者可在用户不知情的情况下，通过构造包含恶意 HTML 代码的电子邮件或网页，诱使用户访问后，强制 WebTV 电子邮件客户端在未经用户授权的情况下自动发送邮件。该漏洞利用了客户端对 HTML 内容的解析缺陷，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可发起攻击，可能导致垃圾邮件发送或信息泄露，影响 WebTV 电子邮件客户端的用户隐私安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0082"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WebTV/MSN TV 升级至官方最新版本（如仍未升级），并在邮件客户端设置中禁用 HTML 内容自动渲染，关闭「允许外部资源自动加载」选项。由于 WebTV 服务已于 2013 年终止运营，长期缓解措施应迁移至现代电子邮件客户端（如 Outlook、Thunderbird），同时在网关过滤包含恶意 JavaScript 或自动表单提交的 HTML 邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://net4tv.com/voice/story.cfm?StoryI