57Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 系统至最新补丁级别，安装 HP 针对 aserver 程序路径注入漏洞的官方安全补丁（PHCO_20199 或更新版本）；在补丁不可用的情况下，移除 aserver 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/aserver），限制本地用户通过修改 PATH 环境变量执行任意 awk 命令导致提权。临时缓解措施可监控 aserver 进程的异常调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5728","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0078","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0078.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0078.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5da0a5f6cef8a27d290daf0d2c65fed1d1f621b9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9pc6-h4q8-hvmv/GHSA-9pc6-h4q8-hvmv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0078.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001073.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3f03bd7f1d1606d853ca070d5f0897c51e140c86/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0063","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0077","title":"HP HP-UX aserver 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.x及11.x系统中 aserver 程序存在路径注入漏洞（PATH Injection），由于 aserver 调用 ps 和 grep 命令时信任用户指定的 PATH 环境变量而非使用绝对路径，本地攻击者可通过在 PATH 中插入恶意路径（如包含特制恶意程序的目录）来劫持这些命令的执行，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.x/11.x 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。漏洞利用无需身份认证以外的特殊条件，但需要本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0077"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 HP-UX 系统至最新支持的版本（如 11i v3），并安装 HP 安全补丁 PHCO_19166 或后续累积补丁。如无法升级，可将 aserver 程序权限改为仅 root 可执行（chmod 700 /usr/sbin/aserver），并在 aserver 脚本中硬编码 PATH 为 /bin:/usr/bin 而非继承用户环境变量，防止 PATH 劫持提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5549","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20396","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0077","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0077.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0077.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcpm-3296-q6gm/GHSA-xcpm-3296-q6gm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0077.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3f03bd7f1d1606d853ca070d5f0897c51e140c86/